import ../../helpers/driver.dl

document text state example:
    editor "Source" containing "abc" using no UI appearance
    paragraph "Caption" containing "Keep this caption" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of text state example
set window to the address of instance
set caption to the UI value for (the control labeled "Caption" in window) in window
set node to the control labeled "Source" in window
set entry to the UI value for node in window
set next to entry's next
set view to a UI view of window sized 400 by 300 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "!" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (entry's text = "abc!") reporting "The initial document did not receive its edit."
set history to entry's undo
color UI text (entry's text) in node in window
add UI text color (UI ink 100 160 220) from 0 to 3 in node in window
mark UI text (entry's text) in node in window
add UI text mark (UI ink 190 120 80) from 3 to 4 with opacity 100 in node in window
set colors to entry's colors
set marks to entry's marks

set parked to a new UI text state
set parked's text to "other"
exchange UI text state for node in (the address of view) with (the address of parked)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((entry's text = "other") and (parked's text = "abc!")) reporting "Exchanging documents did not transfer their text."
require condition ((entry's undo = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit)) and (parked's undo = history)) reporting "The inactive document lost its own undo history."
require condition ((parked's colors = colors) and (parked's marks = marks)) reporting "Inactive document annotations lost their ownership."
require condition ((entry's target = node) and ((entry's next = next) and (caption's text = "Keep this caption"))) reporting "Moving text changed the control identity or its value registry."

queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (entry's text = "other") reporting "Undo in the second document used the first document's history."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 268 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "Z" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((entry's text = "Zother") and (parked's text = "abc!")) reporting "Editing the second document changed the parked first document."

exchange UI text state for node in (the address of view) with (the address of parked)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((entry's text = "abc!") and (entry's undo = history)) reporting "Returning to the first document lost its retained history."
require condition ((entry's colors = colors) and (entry's marks = marks)) reporting "Returning to the first document lost its annotations."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((entry's text = "abc") and (parked's text = "Zother")) reporting "The restored document could not undo independently."
queue UI input of kind 3 key 89 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (entry's text = "abc!") reporting "The restored document could not redo independently."

clear UI text state (the address of parked)
require condition ((parked's text's length = 0) and (parked's undo = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit))) reporting "Clearing an inactive text state retained its resources."
set parked's text to entry's text
set epoch to view's input context's epoch
receive UI composition (the string form of "draft") for epoch at phase 1 selecting 0 through 5 in (the address of view)
exchange UI text state for node in (the address of view) with (the address of parked)
require condition ((view's selection's composing = false) and (view's input context's active = false)) reporting "Changing buffers with identical text retained the preceding composition context."
queue UI input of kind 13 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "Old buffer input" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((entry's text = "abc!") and (view's input context's epoch > epoch)) reporting "A delayed platform event edited a new buffer with identical contents."
clear UI text state (the address of parked)
close the address of view
close window
print line "UI text states retain independent undo and annotations while preserving control identity."
